WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.708
A common workflow is to load data into a DataFrame
register it as a temporary

00:00:04.734 --> 00:00:10.346
view and then query it with SQL The temporary view
is not the same

00:00:10.373 --> 00:00:16.423
as a permanent database view from Module 12 It is
usually session-scoped

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.594
and useful inside notebooks or jobs
